{"id":"rdd61","designation":"RDD 61","title":"Material Exchange Format — Mapping ARRICORE Bitstreams into the MXF Generic Container","state":"active","suite":null,"official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/rdd61/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/rdd61/","checked_at":"2026-11-18"},"scope":"This Registered Disclosure Document (RDD) specifies the mapping of ARRICORE essence as a Picture Essence track of the MXF Constrained Generic Container in frame-wrapped form. It defines the ARRICORE bitstream, the KLV coding, essence container label values, essence coding labels, and SubDescriptor values describing the mapping, as well as the composition of the content package. It also states the layout of MXF Files containing ARRICORE essence, and constraints on applications producing such files.","outline":[{"level":1,"title":"Introduction","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"1 Scope","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"2 Conformance Notation","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"3 Normative References","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"4 Terms and Definitions","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.1 ARRICORE MXF File","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.2 ARRICORE Picture Essence","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.3 binary large object BLOB","page":4},{"level":1,"title":"5 ARRICORE Essence","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"5.1 Introduction (informative)","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"5.2 ARRICORE Picture Essence encoding","page":4},{"level":1,"title":"6 ARRICORE Essence Container","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"6.1 ARRICORE Picture Element KLV Coding","page":5},{"level":3,"title":"6.1.1 Element Key","page":5},{"level":3,"title":"6.1.2 Element Length","page":5},{"level":3,"title":"6.1.3 Element Value","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"6.2 ARRICORE Essence Container Labels","page":6},{"level":2,"title":"6.3 ARRICORE Picture Essence Coding Labels","page":6},{"level":2,"title":"6.4 Metadata","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"6.4.1 General","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"6.4.2 ARRICORE Picture Essence Processin